Simulator artwork: 3D models, rooms and textures

The files in this folder, and everything built from them (the files under
public/sim-assets/ that sim/tools/ generates, and the device icons
public/icons/dev-codebot.png, dev-codex.png and dev-codeair.png), are copyright Firia Labs and
are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
International License (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

  Gymnasium.glb    the gymnasium
  Classroom.glb    a classroom (CodeSpace's classroom1.glb)
  Cafeteria.glb    the cafeteria
  Auditorium.glb   the auditorium (CodeSpace's auditorium.glb)
  BotBody.glb      CodeBot CB3, body
  WheelAssy.glb    CodeBot, wheel
  CodeAIR.glb      CodeAIR, revision C (CodeSpace's CodeAir_revC-2.glb)
  CodeX.glb        CodeX (CodeSpace's CodeXBody.glb); for now only the
                   device icon is drawn from it (sim/tools/render-icons.mjs)

Attribution: "Firia Labs (firialabs.com)".

Music: the rooms' music tracks, when a room brings one (none yet), are under
the same licence. The haunted house rooms' music is by Kid Fears (Atlanta),
commissioned by Firia Labs; credit it as "Music by Kid Fears (Atlanta),
commissioned by Firia Labs". The simulator shows a track's credit in its
settings panel while the track plays.

